<title>USA: U.S. Robotics counters Motorola suit.</title>
<headline>U.S. Robotics counters Motorola suit.</headline>
<dateline>SKOKIE, Ill. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Robotics Corp said Wednesday it has filed an answer and counterclaims in a federal lawsuit brought against it by Motorola Inc alleging patent infringement regarding modem technology.</p>
<p>U.S. Robotics said it is seeking a judgment that Motorola committed patent misuse and violated antitrust laws by abusing the international standards-setting process. U.S. Robotics said it also counterclaimed that Motorola is infringing certain patents owned by U.S. Robotics.</p>
</text>
